  {
   "title": "적분",
   "text": "$$L=\\int_{0}^{2}\\left|\\ln \\frac{1+x}{2}\\right|dx=\\int_{1}^{3}\\left|\\ln u-\\ln 2 \\right|du \\,\\,(u=1+x)$$",
